// Span waterfall:
// [───── Request: 2500ms ─────────────────────────────────────]
//   [── Queue wait: 800ms ──]
//                            [── Conn wait: 500ms ──]
//                                                    [─ DB: 200ms ─]
//                                                                   [──── HTTP: 900ms ────]
//                                                                   [retry1:300][retry2:300][success:300]
// VISUAL! Every segment's time visible! Gaps visible! Retries visible!

// ═══ HIDDEN LATENCY SOURCES ═══
// 1. Queue wait: task submitted → waits in pool queue → finally executes
// 2. Connection wait: getConnection() → all connections busy → wait!
// 3. Silent retries: Spring Retry/Resilience4j retry 3× → 3× latency!
// 4. DNS/TLS/TCP: first request to new host → DNS lookup + TLS handshake
// 5. GC pause: Stop-the-world GC → 200ms pause → all threads frozen!
// 6. Thread scheduling: OS didn't schedule thread → idle wait
